Exabeam catalogs (data/catalogs/exabeam/), generated by scripts/engine/sync_exabeam_catalog.py
from ExabeamLabs/CIMLibrary, the Exabeam Common Information Model, at commit
e72bfa2c97578e267e9197493c382b4e9b956d1a (2026-10-20):
https://github.com/ExabeamLabs/CIMLibrary

fields.toml: the field names, data types and descriptions of
Fields_Descriptions.md, reformatted. The platform fields marked
`platform = true` (approxLogTime, rawLogIds, ingest_time, raw_log_time) and the
`c_` and `m_` prefixes are not in that table; their descriptions are written
for this repository.

values.toml: the subjects, activity types and outcomes of cim.json,
reformatted.

